            "value": "If you wield an attuned Lightsaber with a Dantari Crystal and roll a natural 19 on a Use the Force check made to activate a Force Power, you regain some of your spent Force Powers. If you have a Dark Side Score of 0, you regain all spent Force Powers with the [Light Side] descriptor. If you have a Dark Side Score of 1+, you regain all spent Force Powers with the [Dark Side] descriptor. If you roll a natural 20 on a Use the Force check made to activate a Force Power, you still regain all spent Force Powers.",
